      "title": "Imitation inflammation core",
      "subtitle": "RN-FCA · Experimental and formal research",
      "description": "[
        \"Test object: Collapse crystal seed × 1; paper 2 is used for test records, and the reference sample is recycled\",
        \"Complete the team's experiment at the Honkai Energy Sample Spectral Analysis Array. The test crystal forms a repeatable detection receipt under controlled heat input; the test crystal is consumed or sealed and cannot be directly delivered to the official core; the original quantity of the inspected object is returned, and the experiment is subject to the actual settlement of the machine.\",
        \"After the experiment is completed, choose 580 research points or HDV circuit × 4, tungsten steel plate × 56 to pay the base fee; an additional 7,200 ticks and 515,396,075,520 EU/t are required. The current material pressure is corrected for advanced.\",
        \"The institute deducts power according to the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, the imitation fire core and special metal heating applications are unlocked.\"
      ]",
      "dependencies": [
