        \"After the experiment is completed, choose 760 research points or QSV circuit × 4, tungsten steel plate × 64 to pay the base fee; an additional 8,400 ticks and 2,061,584,302,080 EU/t are required. The current material pressure is corrected for advanced.\",
        \"The institute deducts power according to the total power of the effective energy port. After completion, the stable media regeneration tower is unlocked and divided into gas purification and filter media reuse working conditions; and liquid media regeneration are formulated separately.\"
